title: Declarations
---
// whether the current visitor has already exchanged greetings
<<declare $met = false>>

// guardian tutorial
<<declare $treated_guardian = false>>
<<declare $gifted_guardian = false>>
<<declare $gift_1 = "">>
<<declare $gift_2 = "">>
<<declare $gift_3 = "">>
<<declare $guardian_wants = "">>

<<declare $symptoms = "out of sorts">>
<<declare $visitor_cured = false>>
<<declare $visitor_dead = false>>
<<declare $visitor_ailment = "">>
<<declare $visitor_wants = "">>

// Where the shared option hub should jump for the current visitor.
<<declare $npc_chat = "">>
<<declare $npc_cured = "">>
<<declare $npc_dying = "">>
===

title: Guardian
---
<<if not $treated_guardian>>
    <<jump GuardianFirstBrew>>
<<endif>>
<<refresh_visitor>>
<<set $npc_chat to "GuardianChat">>
<<set $npc_cured to "GuardianCured">>
<<set $npc_dying to "GuardianDying">>
Guardian: Thank you for tending to me, Aruna.
<<jump VisitOptions>>
===

title: GuardianFirstBrew
---
<<if not $gifted_guardian>>
    Guardian: Aruna. The cure for what ails me eludes me, and every day I am weaker.
    Guardian: Could you prepare these herbs to ease my symptoms?
    <<give_guardian_herbs>>
    <<set $gifted_guardian to true>>
    <<mark_met>>
    (You receive 1 {$gift_1}, 1 {$gift_2} and 1 {$gift_3}. Drag them to the empty slots to brew.)
<<else>>
    Guardian: The herbs, Aruna. Please.
<<endif>>
<<offer_concoction>>
<<if $treated_guardian>>
    Guardian: That helps. But it's no cure.
    Guardian: Outdoors to the right are some more herbs. Can you find something to {$guardian_wants}?
<<else>>
    Guardian: Please, Aruna. I won't last long like this.
<<endif>>
===

title: GuardianChat
---
Guardian: ...
<<jump VisitOptions>>
===

title: GuardianCured
---
Guardian: Ah. I can feel the plague losing its grasp from me.
===

title: GuardianDying
---
Guardian: Ah. So this is where my journey ends. Don't lose hope, Aruna.
===

title: LeaveBeforeTending
---
It would be rude to leave before tending to your guest.
===

title: Monk
---
<<refresh_visitor>>
<<set $npc_chat to "MonkChat">>
<<set $npc_cured to "MonkCured">>
<<set $npc_dying to "MonkDying">>
<<if not $met>>
    Monk: Amitabha. May you walk the seven steps of Buddha.
    <<mark_met>>
<<else>>
    Monk: I seek thy help today, thy tonics and elixirs.
<<endif>>
Monk: I feel {$symptoms} today.
<<jump VisitOptions>>
===

title: MonkChat
---
Monk: The old texts call this {$visitor_ailment}. They say to {$visitor_wants}.
<<jump VisitOptions>>
===

title: MonkCured
---
Monk: Amitabha. The heavens still hold compassion for the world.
===

title: MonkDying
---
Monk: Amitabha. Do not hold onto grief, benefactor. We walked the same path, and my steps simply reached the gate a little sooner than yours.
===

title: Bride
---
<<refresh_visitor>>
<<set $npc_chat to "BrideChat">>
<<set $npc_cured to "BrideCured">>
<<set $npc_dying to "BrideDying">>
<<if not $met>>
    Bride: Aannyeong haseyo Unni.
    <<mark_met>>
<<else>>
    Bride: I am more unwell today. Can you help ease my suffering?
<<endif>>
Bride: I feel {$symptoms} today.
<<jump VisitOptions>>
===

title: BrideChat
---
Bride: The physician called it {$visitor_ailment}. Then he said to {$visitor_wants}, bowed, and left.
<<jump VisitOptions>>
===

title: BrideCured
---
Bride: *Deep Bow* Thank you, Aruna unni.
===

title: BrideDying
---
Bride: I will finally see you again, my beloved.
===

title: Beggar
---
<<refresh_visitor>>
<<set $npc_chat to "BeggarChat">>
<<set $npc_cured to "BeggarCured">>
<<set $npc_dying to "BeggarDying">>
<<if not $met>>
    Beggar: Hello, Sister. Alms for a tale of old glory?
    <<mark_met>>
<<else>>
    Beggar: Salves for an old beggar?
<<endif>>
Beggar: I feel {$symptoms} today.
<<jump VisitOptions>>
===

title: BeggarChat
---
Beggar: The woman with a strange orb called it {$visitor_ailment}. She said to {$visitor_wants}. Then she asked for payment.
Aruna: Imagine that.
<<jump VisitOptions>>
===

title: BeggarCured
---
Beggar: Ha! I can feel my toes again. All three of them.
Aruna: You have five.
Beggar: A fortune!
===

title: BeggarDying
---
Beggar: At least in death, I hope I can forgive myself.
===

title: OldBeauty
---
<<refresh_visitor>>
<<set $npc_chat to "OldBeautyChat">>
<<set $npc_cured to "OldBeautyCured">>
<<set $npc_dying to "OldBeautyDying">>
<<if not $met>>
    Old Beauty: Sister.
    <<mark_met>>
<<else>>
    Old Beauty: The world looks worse today. Can you help?
<<endif>>
Old Beauty: I feel {$symptoms} today.
<<jump VisitOptions>>
===

title: OldBeautyChat
---
Old Beauty: My talking mirror says {$visitor_ailment}, and that I should {$visitor_wants}. Rude thing.
<<jump VisitOptions>>
===

title: OldBeautyCured
---
Old Beauty: Ah. The world looks a little brighter.
===

title: OldBeautyDying
---
Old Beauty: I can feel the Yama's cold embrace reaching for me.
===

title: Orphan
---
<<refresh_visitor>>
<<set $npc_chat to "OrphanChat">>
<<set $npc_cured to "OrphanCured">>
<<set $npc_dying to "OrphanDying">>
<<if not $met>>
    Orphan: Big Sis, I miss you.
    Aruna: I missed you too Little rice ball.
    <<mark_met>>
<<else>>
    Orphan: Big Sis, my stomach hurts today. *sniff*
    Aruna: Show me where?
<<endif>>
Orphan: I feel {$symptoms} today.
<<jump VisitOptions>>
===

title: OrphanChat
---
Orphan: The nice lady said I have {$visitor_ailment}, and that someone should {$visitor_wants}.
Orphan: I don't know what that means.
Aruna: It means I have work to do.
<<jump VisitOptions>>
===

title: OrphanCured
---
Orphan: Big Sis! My tummy doesn't hurt!
Aruna: Good. Now go easy on the sweets.
Orphan: Hehe, I will try!
===

title: OrphanDying
---
Orphan: Big Sis... I feel sleepy.
Aruna: No. No, stay awake. Stay with me.
===

title: VisitOptions
---
-> Chat
    <<jump {$npc_chat}>>
-> Offer Concoction
    <<jump VisitorOfferConcoction>>
-> Bye
    <<stop>>
===

title: VisitorOfferConcoction
---
Aruna: I have just the thing.
<<offer_concoction>>
<<refresh_visitor>>
<<if $visitor_dead>>
    Aruna: No—wait. Breathe. Please.
    <<jump {$npc_dying}>>
<<elseif $visitor_cured>>
    <<jump {$npc_cured}>>
<<else>>
    Aruna: Not enough. You still feel {$symptoms}.
    <<jump VisitOptions>>
<<endif>>
===
